<SimpleContentLayout
  eyebrow="Legal"
  title="Privacy policy"
  intro="How Siscodex collects, uses and protects the information of those who visit this site or hire our services."
  description="Siscodex's privacy policy."
  path="/en/legal/privacidad"
>
  <h2>Data we collect</h2>
  <p>
    We only collect the information you voluntarily submit through our contact form (name,
    company, email, phone and project description). This site does not use tracking cookies or
    third-party analytics.
  </p>

  <h2>Use of information</h2>
  <p>
    The information submitted is used exclusively to respond to your contact request and, if you
    move forward with a project, for its commercial and technical management. We do not share
    your data with third parties for advertising purposes.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    For requests related to your personal data, write to us at <a href="mailto:hola@siscodex.com"
      >hola@siscodex.com</a
    >.
  </p>
</SimpleContentLayout>
